{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "97736487-1264-896c-8846-3da811dd4fe4",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T09:20:12-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sal Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:16:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:16:38-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi Lorraine. I've got a puddle on my street that won't go away. It's been sitting there forever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:16:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A puddle that won't go away. Okay. Where is this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:16:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "434 Marsh Street, down the Point. It runs across about half the road, and it's just sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:16:58-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "434 Marsh Street, in the Point. And how long has it been there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:04-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's the thing. It hasn't rained since last Thursday. Last Thursday! So it's not a storm thing. It should've drained by now, and it hasn't moved an inch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not since last Thursday. So it's dry weather and the water is still standing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Still standing, yeah. Cars go through it and throw it up on the sidewalk. And in this cold it's going to turn to ice at night. I'm not happy about it, honestly. Somebody should've looked at this already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Is it right near a storm drain, do you know? Or a catch basin at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:45-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A catch basin, yeah, there's one right at the low spot. Right at the low spot. I can see the grate from my front step. The water's just sitting around it, not going down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:17:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the water's pooled around the grate and not going down. Does it look like leaves or debris are covering it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some leaves, maybe, but not enough to block it. Not enough to block it, I wouldn't think. I took photos, by the way. I got a few from the porch and one up close. I can send them if you give me somewhere to send them."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. Let me get a work order started and I'll note that you have photos. Can I get your name and a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sal Santoro. 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sal Santoro, 401-555-0165. Got it. Hang on one second while I enter this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time. [pause] I'm doing the crossword in the meantime, I do them in pen, and I'm stuck on one anyway. Seven letters, \"stubborn stain.\" Drives me nuts."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:18:55-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm not much help there, I'm afraid. Okay, I've got it in. Marsh Street at 434, standing water at the catch basin, no rain since last Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So who do I call to get it checked? Is that you, or is there a crew I should call directly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Calling here is the right place. The work order goes to the drainage crew, and they'll go out and look at the basin. As for the photos, I'll have to find out where those should go. Can I call you back on that number with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call me back, okay. That works. Just don't let it sit, because it's been days already. Days already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:40-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it so they know it's been standing since before the weekend. I can't give you the exact day they'll get there, but it's logged today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Logged today. Okay. And if it freezes before they come?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:19:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it ices over and gets dangerous, call back and tell me, and I'll flag it as a hazard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:20:05-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A hazard. Fine. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T09:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Sal. Expect my call. Bye now."
    }
  ],
